  {:id :round-start-affordability-order
   :status :reproduced-order-dependent-behavior
   :cards [:revised-base/a090 :revised-base/b097 :revised-base/b016]
   :authority :engine-invariant-and-card-text
   :expected "At round start, Scholar can play Mining Hammer for 1 wood, gaining 1 food, which can then pay Plow Driver. Both round-start occupations were already in play."
   :actual "At 0 food, drain discards Plow Driver before the player can choose Scholar first. With occupation order reversed the same sequence works."
